MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec
# 例外：本仓库的打包配置是手写维护的（不是 PyInstaller 自动生成的），
# 发布产物与 CI 都依赖它。之前被上面的 *.spec 一起忽略掉了，
# 结果仓库里根本没有这个文件——克隆下来的人无法复现发布包，CI 也无从打包。
!build_local.spec

